# Godot must not scan this directory (editor filesystem scan and export honour .gdignore).
#
# This gate lives inside the real project at project/, and run_export_contract.ps1
# leaves per-case copies of the project under out/ (out/ itself is gitignored, so a
# marker there could not be committed). Those copies duplicate this addon - the same
# .gd.uid UIDs and the same global class_names - and add exported players, DLLs and
# PCKs, so scanning them would produce duplicate-UID and duplicate-global-class
# errors, re-import 1.1 GB per run, and pull the copies into an all_resources export
# of this project.
#
# Keep the marker HERE. Do not put one in fixture/ (it is copied into every case
# project and would hide the fixture from its own import/export) or in out/
# (gitignored and recreated per run).
#
# Probe scripts are launched by absolute path with --script and read files through
# FileAccess, so ignoring this directory does not affect them. See projectmem #0171.
